8280-26-030937"}],"bear":[{"text":"Insiders disposed of 62.0% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (568,618 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1856314/000163387726000008/0001633877-26-000008-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 5.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.05,"consecutive":2,"current":0.197,"current_display":"19.7%","threshold_display":"5.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Debt to equity rises above 1.00","metric":"debt_to_equity","comparison":"above","threshold":1.0,"consecutive":1,"current":0.0,"current_display":"0.00","threshold_display":"1.00","fired":false,"rationale":"Past this point creditors, not shareholders, decide what happens next.","editable":true},{"id":"going_concern","kind":"event","label":"Going-concern doubt appears in any filing","metric":"going_concern","comparison":"is_true","threshold":true,"current":false,"current_display":"not present","fired":false,"rationale":"The auditors saying the company may not survive the year is not a signal to interpret. It is the exit.","editable":false}],"team":[{"raw_name":"Seidman Becker Caryn","role":"Officer","title_filed":"Chief Executive Officer","shares":151787.0,"sold_in_window":284309.0,"bought_in_window":0.0,"last_filing":"2026-07-17","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001856314","confide